# Castle stair: shelf fungi spiralling up round a stem that stands at the origin (the keep's), twenty steps of 25 cm each from the
# front (+z) round towards +x, up through the opening in the keep's ring to its top at 5 m. The shelves are 1.9 m deep, 33 cm apart on their middle line (37 degrees),
# and reach 1.1 m or more out from the keep's stem. The layout mirrors it for the second stair on the other side.
